## Global Rule Instructions

1. Cross-layer / call-direction work → read `docs/architecture/arch-layer-constraints.md`. No exceptions.

2. UI-layer changes → read and follow `docs/architecture/ui-layer-constraints.md`. No exceptions.

3. UI build (business-layer copy) → read and follow `docs/business/ui-build-constraints.md`. No exceptions.

4. Spark frontend / Tauri invoke / ACL → read and follow `docs/architecture/spark-coding-discipline.md`. No exceptions.

5. Unit tests (Rust / JS / TS) → read and follow `docs/test/unit-test-principles.md`. No exceptions.
